  "title": "Night at Ithra",
  "summary": "An exclusive family experience for Ithra members. Imagine Ithra transformed into a living, breathing home, where footsteps soften and a new experience begins. &ldquo;A Night at Ithra&rdquo; is an immersive evening for families to explore a range of curated spaces across Ithra. The program moves through key locations including the Children&rsquo;s Museum, library, theater, museum, and outdoor areas, with each stop offering a different activity or perspective. The evening concludes with a shared meal and an optional film screening. Designed for families with children aged 7 and above.",
